            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h2>Quick Summary</h2><p>The Clearly Innovative lifetime limited warranty covers qualifying defects in glass chair mats for the life of the product when used as intended. Approved remedies may include repair or replacement, while customers remain responsible for shipping and transportation costs. Coverage applies only to the original purchaser at the original shipped location and excludes scratches, misuse, metal casters, accidents and unauthorized alterations.</p>"
