        "text_qb98QE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p><strong>Warranty at a Glance</strong></p><p>• <strong>Coverage: </strong>Defects for the life of the product during normal intended use.<br/>• <strong>Who is covered: </strong>The original purchaser at the original shipped location.<br/>• <strong>Approved claim remedy: </strong>Clearly Innovative may repair or replace the product at its sole option and may also offer a refund as described in the full terms.<br/>• <strong>Shipping: </strong>The customer is responsible for shipping and transportation costs.</p><h2>What the Warranty Covers</h2><p>Clearly Innovative's warranty applies to its <a href=\"/collections/chair-mats\" title=\"/collections/chair-mats\">glass chair mats</a> when a product defect causes a mat to fail during normal, intended use.<br/>• Coverage lasts for the life of the product.<br/>• Clearly Innovative may repair or replace a covered mat at its sole option.<br/>• Repairs or replacement are made at no charge for the remedy itself, while the customer remains responsible for shipping and transportation costs.</p><h2>What Is Not Covered</h2><p>The published warranty excludes failures or damage associated with the following:<br/>• Scratching<br/>• Abuse, misuse or mishandling<br/>• <a href=\"/products/desk-chair-casters\" title=\"/products/desk-chair-casters\">Using chairs with metal casters</a><br/>• Contact with metal furniture legs<br/>• Use not as intended<br/>• Accidents<br/>• Unauthorized alterations</p><h2>Who Is Covered</h2><p>Coverage extends only to the original purchaser at the original shipped location.<br/><br/>If an authorized product reseller makes a warranty claim, Clearly Innovative reserves the option to replace the defective product as part of a future shipment of mats to that reseller.</p><h2>How to File a Warranty Claim</h2><p><em>The current website does not publish the claim-submission details below. Client confirmation is required before this section is finalized:</em></p><p><strong>1. Contact method: </strong>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM: phone, email or form and the preferred contact details.]</p><p><strong>2. Information to include: </strong>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM: order number, photos of the defect, purchase date and any other required documentation.]</p><p><strong>3. After submission: </strong>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM: review process and what the customer can expect after submitting a claim.]</p><p><strong>4. Response time: </strong>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM: expected response time.]</p><h2>Your Remedy Options</h2><p>Clearly Innovative retains the right to repair or replace the product or offer a full refund of the purchase price at its sole discretion. The stated remedy is the purchaser's sole and exclusive remedy for a warranty breach, and total liability for a defective product is limited to the purchase price.</p><p>For policies that apply to non-warranty returns, review the <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Returns and Exchanges policy.</a></p>"
